You won't want to miss this! 
 ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌

Hi there,

Maddie here from Originality.AI!

We have been teasing you with a very exciting new feature for a few
weeks now and we are finally ready to share what we've been working
on!!!

Soon, a state of the art 

****Fact Checking Assistant****will be available to you at
Originality.AI! 

In a world inundated with online content, both human written and AI
generated, discerning fact from fiction has become increasingly
challenging and time consuming. 

At Originality.AI, we understand the vital role accurate content plays
in shaping opinions, decisions, and preserving your reputation as
content creators. Our mission has always been to empower our users with
the quality assurance tools they need to create content with
integrity. 

With our new Fact Checking Feature, we are taking a major step toward
that mission, while equipping you with a tool that will save you hours
of editing time. 

Here's what you can expect:

**Real-time Fact Checking:** Our advanced AI will cross-reference the
information in your content, ensuring that statements are backed by
trusted sources. No cut off date! Get up to the minute facts verified.

**In Text Fact Highlighting:**Our application will detect and highlight
statements within your content by colour, giving you a visual of
potentially true and potentially false statements. 

**In App Verification Sources:** Our in App verification feature will
allow the user to click on a highlighted statement and read an
explanation on why our application believes the statement is true or
false, all while providing the user with supporting sources. 

**Check out a Demo below! **

https://jonhaver.acemlnb.com/lt.php?s=c2aa77b6f0a29bb9a1c1a13f88329783&i=1991A2153A61A30596 

If this sounds like something your business would benefit from, we
invite you to become a BETA User. As an early adopter of Originality.AI,
your participation and feedback is critical to our success. 

To apply to become a BETA user Fill out the application form below 

BETA USER APPLICATION 

**Meet Us at Content Marketing World in Washington, DC THIS WEEK! **

Originality.AI is a proud Sponsor and Exhibitor at Content Marketing
World in Washington, DC  this
week! 

This event is the perfect opportunity for us to connect with you in
person and share our latest news and features. 

If you are attending this conference we'd love to meet up with you!
Book a time slot with me here to connect in person. 

Book an in-Person Meeting at CMW

Thanks for reading! 

  

Sent to: patriogabrielpatdu@gmail.com

Unsubscribe

Jon Gillham, 1 First Street Suite #220, Collingwood, Ontario L9Y 1A1, Canada
